---
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---
<section id="projects" class="section works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-top">
      <div><p class="section-label">01 / SELECTED WORK</p><h2 class="section-heading">我做过的工具。</h2></div>
      <p class="section-note">每个项目，都从一个具体的不方便开始。<br />可以看案例，也可以打开网站体验。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project-list">
      {siteConfig.projects.map(project => (
        <article id={`project-${project.number}`} class="project-row">
          <div class="project-copy">
            <p class="project-category"><span class="mono">{project.number}</span> {project.category}</p>
            <h3>{project.name}</h3><p class="project-subtitle">{project.subtitle}</p>
            <div class="project-story"><p><span>为什么做</span>{project.problem}</p><p><span>我做了什么</span>{project.solution}</p></div>
            <p class="project-result">{project.result}</p>
            {project.number === '02' && <div class="project-metrics"><span><strong>38</strong> 件作品</span><span><strong>359</strong> 条反馈</span></div>}
            <div class="skill-tags">{project.skills.map(skill => <span>{skill}</span>)}</div>
            <div class="project-links"><a class="button small" href={project.link} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开网站 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{project.source && <a class="text-link" href={project.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub源码 ↗</a>}{project.guide && <a class="text-link" href={project.guide} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">演示说明 ↗</a>}</div>
            <p class="access-note">{project.access}</p>
          </div>
          <div class={`project-visual ${project.color}`}>
            {project.image ? (
              <figure>
                <button class={`image-button ${project.number === '01' ? 'tall-preview' : ''}`} data-image={project.image} data-caption={project.imageAlt} aria-label={`查看${project.name}完整截图`}>
                  <div class="window-bar"><span class="window-dots">● ● ●</span><span>{project.name}</span><span aria-hidden="true">⤢</span></div>
                  <img src={project.image} alt={project.imageAlt} loading="lazy" width={project.number === '01' ? '1440' : '1100'} height={project.number === '01' ? '2002' : '350'} />
                </button>
                <figcaption>{project.caption}<span>点击查看大图 ↗</span></figcaption>
              </figure>
            ) : (
              <div class="directory-diagram" role="img" aria-label="协会名录功能示意：地图检索、组织详情、资料审核和活动同步">
                <p class="diagram-label">平台功能示意</p><div class="directory-search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span> 寻找医工融合的合作伙伴</div>
                <div class="directory-nodes"><span>高校组织</span><span class="node-center">医工融合<br />协会名录</span><span>活动动态</span></div>
                <div class="directory-features"><span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i> 地图检索</span><span><i aria-hidden="true">▤</i> 组织详情</span><span><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i> 资料审核</span><span><i aria-hidden="true">↻</i> 推文同步</span></div>
                <p class="diagram-footer">找到组织 · 了解活动 · 持续维护</p>
              </div>
            )}
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="more-work">
      <div class="more-heading"><h3>也把方法做成可复用的工具。</h3><a class="text-link" href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我的GitHub ↗</a></div>
      <div class="repo-grid">
        <article class="repo-card">
          <div class="repo-image"><img src="/assets/ppt-preview.jpg" width="1260" height="1330" loading="lazy" alt="PPT Image Share Builder生成的13页医疗器械飞行检查演示拼图" /></div>
          <div class="repo-body"><p class="section-label">CODEX SKILL</p><h4>PPT Image Share Builder</h4><p>把源材料整理、逐页图片生成、整套预览检查和PPTX封装连起来。这里是医疗器械飞行检查主题的完整演示。</p><div class="repo-links"><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/uuoov/ppt-image-share-builder" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看仓库 ↗</a><button class="text-link" data-image="/assets/ppt-preview.jpg" data-caption="13页演示拼图：PPT Image Share Builder">查看作品大图 ↗</button></div></div>
        </article>
        <article class="repo-card briefing-card">
          <div class="briefing-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="briefing-mark">AM<span>BRIEFING</span></div><div class="briefing-flow"><span>采集</span><i>→</i><span>筛选</span><i>→</i><span>归档</span></div></div>
          <div class="repo-body"><p class="section-label">OPENCLAW SKILL</p><h4>Tech Morning Briefing</h4><p>将科技新闻采集、评分分类、精选推送和飞书文档归档串成流程，尝试让重复的信息整理变成可复用的工作方式。</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/uuoov/tech-morning-briefing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看仓库 ↗</a></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
